ebb is a port of missionary to jolt (https://github.com/jolt-lang/jolt). It is
pure Clojure: the JVM and ClojureScript host layers, the cloroutine dependency,
and the reactive-streams integration are not carried over. Files derived from
missionary carry a header naming the missionary source they came from.

